# Store and check out text with LF everywhere. Migration checksums
# (db/migrate.py) and the archived-migration hashes in
# db/tests/test_branch_upgrade.py are taken over exact bytes, so a CRLF
# checkout on Windows would make an unchanged migration look edited.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary fixtures and assets are never normalized.
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.PNG binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.xlsx binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
